{"sourceUrl":"https://sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/zs/zsgg/202507/t20250728_7897411.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.535915+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/zs/zsgg/202507/t20250728_7897411.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span>沈阳自动化研究所</span><span><span>成立于</span>1958<span>年</span></span><span>。作为</span><span><span>中国机器人事业的摇篮，在中国机器人事业发展历史上创造了二十多个第一，引领了中国机器人技术的研究发展，</span></span><span>在机器人学、工业机器人、水下机器人、空间机器人及自动化、特种机器人、先进光电技术与系统、无线传感与通信技术、机器人化工艺装备及智能产线等研究与开发方面取得大批成果，形成技术领先优势。</span><span><span>成功孵化了新松机器人自动化股份有限公司、沈阳芯源微电子设备股份有限公司等</span>10<span>余家高技术企业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>沈阳自动化</span></span><span>研究</span><span><span>所已发展成为具有现代化科研与工作条件、具有一流科学家和科技队伍的国立科研机构，是</span><span>“<span>机器人与智能系统全国重点实验室</span></span><span>”“</span><span>机器人技术国家工程研究中心</span><span>”“</span><span>国家机器人创新中心</span><span>”“</span><span>国家机器人质量监督检验中心（辽宁）</span><span>”</span><span>等十多个国家和省部级平台的依托单位</span></span><span>。牵头承办中国科学院大学机器人与智能制造学院。</span></p><p><span><span>为让大学生了解沈阳自动化研究所在机器人、智能制造和光电信息技术等领域的研究特色和科研实力，感受科研氛围和研究生培养特色，引导与激发大学生的科研兴趣和热情，我所将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span>8<span>月</span></span><span>举</span><span>行暑期学校</span><span>活动。现面向全国高校招收营员，并将相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、活动时间和形式</span></strong></p><p><span><span>活动时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><span>活动形式：举办线下活动</span></p><p><strong><span>二、主要内容</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、参加院士、专家主讲的学术报告，了解自动化领域的发展状况；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、参观我所各所区、成果展览室及部分研究室； </span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、组织营员到感兴趣的课题组进行科研体验；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>、组织营员与我所在读研究生进行交流联欢； </span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>、组织研究生考核；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>、组织营员参观了解沈阳。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、报名条件</span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、营员招收对象：全国各高校将于</span><span>2026</span><span>年毕业的机械、自动化、</span></span><span>机器人工程、智能制造、</span><span>计算机、通信、</span><span>电子信息、人工智能、数学、船舶与海洋工程<span>、</span></span><span>电气、</span><span>大数据、</span><span>物理、光学等相关专业的在校本科生；</span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，在学期间无重修科目或补考记录，在校期间没有受过纪律处分；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>、身心健康，无不良记录。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、申请办法及时间要求</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、报名自即日起，至</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>日结束。网上报名需要在</span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>17:00</span><span>之前完成。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、报名流程</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）网上报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>登录科教结合协同育人行动计划网站（</span><span>http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/</span><span>），选择“夏令营”栏目，选择“沈阳自动化研究所</span></span><span>机器人与智能制造夏</span><span><span>令营</span><span>”。此网址为中国科学院大学网上申报系统，请及时申报。</span></span><span><span>(</span><span>若前期已申报，直接扫描下方二维码即可</span><span>)</span></span></p><p><span>（2）</span><span><span>扫描报名二维码，填写报名信息。</span></span><span>（所有报名同学均需填写）</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/zs/zsgg/202507/W020250728481269024390_ORIGIN.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span><span>、营员资格认定</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>网上资格审核</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>审核</span></strong><strong><span><span>工作将于</span>8<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>13</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日结束，入选暑期学校营员名单将通过短信通知（未入选者，不再另行通知），并辅以邮件通知。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span>提供申请材料</span></p><p><strong><span>注：报名时不需要提供申请材料；确定获取入营资格后</span></strong><strong><span>再提交，提交方式另行通知：</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span><span>“中国科学院大学大学生夏令营申请表”一份；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>两封推荐信，推荐人须具有</span><strong><span>副教授或相当</span></strong><span>以上职称（详见附件</span><span>1</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><span>本科学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科成绩单以及成绩排名证明（无固定格式要求）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>《沈阳自动化研究所研究生政治审查表》（详见附件</span><span>2</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span><span>《沈阳自动化研究所夏令营活动安全责任协议书》（详见附件</span><span>3</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）</span><span>获奖证明材料（体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文复印件、获奖证书复印件、英语四、六级证书复印件等）。</span></p><p><span>请将申请材料按照申请表、推荐信、成绩单、政审表、</span><span>获奖证明材料</span><span>的顺序排列好，</span><span><span>A4</span><span>纸打印，每份材料分别左侧</span></span><span>装订。</span></p><p><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>暑期学校</span></strong><strong><span>资助</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>、</span><span>暑期学校</span><span>期间在沈阳的食宿。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、单程路费。实报实销营员从高校或家庭所在城市至沈阳的火车硬座（含高铁二等座）、硬卧（单程</span><span>8</span><span>小时以上）或轮船三等舱及以下的车船票费用，沈阳市内车费不予报销，</span><strong><span>乘坐飞机按照</span></strong><strong><span>不超过</span></strong><strong><span>高铁二等座报销。</span></strong></p><p><span>3</span><span>、对于通过推免考核并录取为我所</span><span>2025</span><span>年研究生的营员，在入学报到后为其报销返程车船费，请保存好返程车船票。</span></p><p><strong><span>七</span></strong><strong><span>、优秀推</span></strong><strong><span>免</span></strong><strong><span>生奖学金</span></strong></p><p><span>为录取至所内的国内优秀高校推免生提供一次性奖励，具体</span><span>资助</span><span>标准可电话咨询。</span></p><p><strong><span>八</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>后续</span></strong><strong><span>安排</span></strong></p><p><span>暑期学校</span><span>日程安排，审核通过后另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>九</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：吴老师</span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span><span>024-23970457</span></span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：辽宁省沈阳市浑南区创新路</span><span>135</span><span>号</span><span>3</span><span>号楼</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：</span><span>110169</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail: </span></span><a href=\"mailto:zs@sia.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>zs@sia.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span><span>网址：</span><span>http://www.sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/</span></span></p><p><span><span>导师介绍：</span><span>http://www.sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/dsjj/</span></span></p><p><strong><span>十</span></strong><strong><span>、其他</span></strong></p><p><span>审核通过后，如遇特殊情况无法参加</span><span>暑期学校</span><span><span>可发送邮件至</span><span>zs@sia.cn</span><span>说明情况。</span></span></p><p><span>活动日程安排请及时</span><span>留意邮箱及短信通知</span><span>。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>                         <span>中国科学院沈阳自动化研究所</span></span></p><p><span>                                   <span>招生办</span></span></p><p><span>                               <span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>28</span></span><span>日</span></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"3d9a483b46521083136cd1b651ec5cbed30ae748017edca679d34f8e56002236","textLength":1927,"sourceSha256":"109c273f51c1924062857dea2608f93f750c9981a743ff1c10520dad55690138","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7e83939e9a57d122d8c9","title":"2025年中国科学院沈阳自动化研究所关于举办2025年“机智过人，智见未来”大学生暑期学校的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.535915+00:00"}
